            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Trayage 1.0 (4)</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Check for updates from the app menu, menu-bar popover, General settings, or About.</li>
  <li>Opt into daily update checks while Trayage is running. Review what changed and choose when to download and install.</li>
  <li>Updates and the update feed are signed, and the app is notarized by Apple.</li>
  <li>Fixes switching from Light to Device appearance so billing controls follow your Mac’s appearance.</li>
</ul>
